tegories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"mpTKUG5U7rq2yYP7u3719w","review_id":"thYmcZQwsfQbwaKPYvTBjA","date":"2017-12-10T20:48:57","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9467236399650574,"text_excerpt":"I love this place. They have a variety of different rolls that do not have a ton of artificial crabmeat like most sushi places. Also, I like the fact you can get brown rice. Service is always good. Parking can be tight if they are busy. Great location in Lakeview. One of my favorite sushi places to go."},{"business_id":"mpTKUG5U7rq2yYP7u3719w","review_id":"sB1q2iGSW9tI89hXPgjEag","date":"2015-01-26T20:30:19","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9465804100036621,"text_excerpt":"I went to Lakeview Pearl with a big group on a Saturday night and enjoyed it. I thought the sushi was comparable to Ninja, which is my usual sushi spot. The hot and sour soup was really good. Quite spicy and flavorful. We shared lots of different rolls, including a 911, spicy tuna crunchy, rainbow, burning man, crazy girl, and playboy. All of them were good. I particularly appreciated that they didn't fall apart too easily. I hate when that happens! Then you have to scoop the bits and pieces out of the soy sauce, which isn't easy to do with chopsticks. The service was great. They were friendly and attentive and didn't seem bothered by our big group with lots of requests. Can't comment on ..."},{"business_id":"mpTKUG5U7rq2yYP7u3719w","review_id":"z1semt326ALunTnXb_8oUQ","date":"2015-03-23T20:26:02","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.946132242679596,"text_excerpt":"While not my favorite sushi in NOLA, this is definitely a great place. I often do take-out and load up on their specialty rolls. Very convenient now that I've moved to Lakeview. The restaurant itself has great atmosphere and decor. The sushi is always fresh and well prepared."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"mpTKUG5U7rq2yYP7u3719w","photo_id":"q0ZR10FBJB1F9cFN19Zl3g","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/q0ZR10FBJB1F9cFN19Zl3g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9087496399879456},{"business_id":"mpTKUG5U7rq2yYP7u3719w","photo_id":"A2z8fOG-vQlsxiCj-wWqZg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/A2z8fOG-vQlsxiCj-wWqZg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8740498423576355},{"business_id":"mpTKUG5U7rq2yYP7u3719w","photo_id":"Kjb-MuFfKPQZpLpVbIz2xg","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/Kjb-MuFfKPQZpLpVbIz2xg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8685516119003296},{"business_id":"mpTKUG5U7rq2yYP7u3719w","photo_id":"hV6bM_toSLaSG4xq52n6KA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/hV6bM_toSLaSG4xq52n6KA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8311691284179688},{"business_id":"mpTKUG5U7rq2yYP7u3719w","photo_id":"W2eMd8i2yNNpTgq565REsw","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/W2eMd8i2yNNpTgq565REsw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8130102753639221}]},"notebook_case":null}
